{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "e6e0eeb0-3787-8773-b29d-cdd8d9dc692c",
  "created_at": "2026-01-15T09:13:02-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Cristina Amaral",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:11:11-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. Good morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:11:14-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. Yes, my name is Cristina Amaral. I am calling because, um, I have a problem with the trash. A neighbor, he puts his bags at the corner, near my house. Again and again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:11:25-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, he's leaving bags out on the corner. Is that on a street, or on your property?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:11:31-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "On the corner, by the sidewalk. Not on my land, but so close. It is, how do we say at home, [pause] um, uma falta de respeito. A lack of respect."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:11:41-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. What's the address there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:11:44-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three twenty-one Kay Street. The corner is right next to my gate. The bags sit there for days and the gulls open them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:11:52-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 321 Kay Street. Are they there right now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:11:56-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, since Monday. Four bags, maybe five. I do not want trouble with him. I only want it gone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:12:02-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll put in a request for a crew to look at it and pick up what's there. Then someone can follow up about the dumping."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:12:10-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Is there a fee for this? I am on a small pension, you understand. I do not want to be charged for his garbage."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:12:18-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, you wouldn't be charged for a report or for the city picking up bags that aren't yours. You're not responsible for them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:12:25-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. That is a relief. I was already cross this morning, so. I went for my walk to Portsmouth yesterday, no, I mean my niece drove me, to the diner I like, with the breakfast all day. And I came home and the bags were still there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:12:39-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that's a nice outing, but I'm sorry you came home to that. Do you want me to put your phone number on the request?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:12:47-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. It is four-oh-one, five five five, oh one five nine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:12:51-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-nine. Perfect. Someone should be out in the next day or two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:12:56-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Denise. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T09:12:59-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Mrs. Amaral. Bye now."
    }
  ],
